        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2002 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Nerve complications following cardiac catheterization via the femoral route are rare. We report a case of meralgia paresthetica, a mononeuropathy affecting the lateral cutaneous nerve of the thigh following uncomplicated cardiac catheterization and percutaneous intervention via this route."
